<title>CHINA: China Jan-Apr crude, natural gas output up.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Apr crude, natural gas output up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 53.4896 million tonnes of crude oil in the first four months of 1997, up 3.7 percent compared with the year-ago period, the State Statistical Bureau said Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 13.48 million tonnes of crude oil in April alone, the bureau has said.</p>
<p>China's natual gas output reached 8.225 billion cubic metres from Januatry to April, up 10.7 percent compared with the same 1996 period, it said.</p>
<p>Natural gas output in April alone was 2.143 billion cubic metres, it said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
